# value-quoted-escapes

## Input

```mical
a "h\"i"
b 'sin\'gle'
c "back\\slash"
d "tab\there"
e "line\nbreak"
f "cr\rreturn"

```

## JSON

```json
{
  "a": "h\"i",
  "b": "sin'gle",
  "c": "back\\slash",
  "d": "tab\there",
  "e": "line\nbreak",
  "f": "cr\rreturn"
}
```

vim:ft=markdown
